@startuml Deletion of User's Attributes
autonumber
actor "User" as user

box User's Device
participant "Wallet Instance" as app
participant "External Application" as ext
end box

box Relying Party
participant "Support Contact" as rp
end box

  user -> app: Invoke attribute deletion functionality
  app -> user: Show list of Relying Parties \nin possession of User's attributes
  user -> app: Select the Relying Party

  note over app
    The Wallet Instance obtains the support contact
    (support_uri or WRPAC support URI)
  end note

  app -> user: Show available contacts
  user -> app: Select the contact
  app -> app: Log the data deletion request
  app -> ext: Invoke browser, mail client, or phone
  ext -> rp: Data deletion request

  note over user, rp
    The Relying Party authenticates the User
    and deletes the attributes.
    Completion of the deletion is outside this protocol.
  end note

  app -> user: Notify that the request was initiated
@enduml
